  "fullDescription": "Unleash your inner comic book artist with the Ultimate Procreate Comic Brush Bundle by An Inkling of Curry! This all-in-one bundle includes 7 versatile brushsets crafted for comic creators, illustrators, and storytellers who want to bring their panels to life with ease and style.\n\nWhether you’re sketching dramatic poses, laying out dynamic panels, adding expressive faces, or placing eye-catching speech bubbles — this bundle has everything you need to create professional-quality comics and graphic novels directly on your iPad.\n\n🔧 Included Brushsets (7 Total):\nSpeech Bubbles – Comic dialogue made easy with bursts, whispers, thoughts, and more.\n\nFacial Expressions – From shock to joy, cover every emotion with stylized face stamps.\n\nPose & Gesture – Dynamic poses and quick figure guides to speed up character sketching.\n\nPanel Layouts – Classic and experimental panel grids to structure your comic flow.\n\nBackgrounds – Cityscapes, interiors, speedlines, and environment enhancers.\n\nAtmospheric Elements – Add mood with fog, shadows, lighting, and ambiance brushes.\n\nEffects – Explosions, sparks, motion lines, and halftone overlays for added drama.\n\n🧰 Features:\nFully compatible with Procreate on iPad\n\nOrganized and labeled brushsets for easy navigation\n\nPerfect for comic books, webtoons, manga, graphic novels, and storyboarding\n\nDesigned with creators, storytellers, and illustrators in mind\n\nEasy to use – just import and start drawing!\n\n📦 What You Get:\n7 .brushset files (1 for each category)\n\n185 total brushes",
